ional characters\n- additional objects\n- weapons that are not already requested\n- particles\n- decorative elements\n\nDo not add anything unrelated to the provided characters or background.\n\nThe final image must contain:\nthe original background,\nCharacter 01 on the left,\nCharacter 02 on the right,\nwith both characters in different dynamic poses.\n\nKeep the artwork family-friendly and non-graphic.",
